# Oath of Druids "puts that card onto the battlefield and all other cards revealed this way into their graveyard", in that
# order (CR 608.2c): Bot1 reveals Swamp, Swamp, Moonshadow at its upkeep. Moonshadow enters with six -1/-1 counters first,
# then the two Swamps - permanent cards - go to Bot1's graveyard while it has one, so it triggers once and loses a counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Oath of Druids
Swamp x4
Swamp
Swamp
Moonshadow
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oath of Druids.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Oath of Druids; Moonshadow
Bot1.Battlefield.Moonshadow.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 5
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
